        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek S30003HL, Modern Stainless Steel Helios Lever with Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stainless Steel Helios Lever with Square Rose is ultra modern with its slim lever and square rose pairing. This satin stainless steel leverset is easily installed on most pre-drilled doors and will bring any space into the modern age. The Modern Stainless Steel Helios Lever with Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Helios Door Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid stainless steel lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"text\">\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Helios Lever with Modern Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Square: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8 - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-S30003HL-specifications.gif?v=1704354769\" width=\"237\" height=\"157\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek S30003HL Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n Levers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Stainless Steel Helios Lever with Square Rose",
                "description": "The Stainless Steel Helios Lever with Square Rose is ultra modern with its slim lever and square rose pairing. This satin stainless steel leverset is easily installed on most pre-drilled doors and will bring any space into the modern age. The Modern Stainless Steel Helios Lever with Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
